Aaj chehlum tamaam hota hai<br>
Dafn sab ka imaam hota hai<br>
Wehshatou ka ab maqaam hota hai<br>
Dard gardu'n qayaam hota hai<br>
<br>
Tan e sheh aaj sar se milta hai <br>
Arsh e qaaliq dobara hilta hai<br>
____________________________<br>
Karbala me hai aaj shewan o shain<br>
Dafn hoti hai aaj laash e hussain<br>
Roti kubra hai sheh ki noorul ain<br>
Baano e shaah hai bohat bechain<br>
<br>
Ro ro zainab dohaayi deti hai<br>
Karwate'n sheh ki laash leti hai<br>
____________________________<br>
Shash jehat me hai shor wawaila<br>
Aati hai ye malayeka ki sada<br>
Qaid se chutkar imaam aaj aaya<br>
Aaj ek hashr phir bapa hoga<br>
<br>
Chalo aye qoum peshwaayi ko<br>
Laao zainab falak satayi ko<br>
____________________________<br>
Aage aage the jibraeel e amee'n <br>
Unke piche malayeka ghamgee'n<br>
Phaink kar taaj e sar ba roo-e- zamee'n<br>
Aaye beemar karbala ke qaree'n<br>
<br>
Haa milaane alam ko le aaye<br>
Qatl gah me haram ko le aaye<br>
____________________________<br>
Aaj sajjad ko ghash aate hai<br>
Ghash se fursat jo zara paate hai<br>
Baap ki laash ko hilaate hai<br>
Gathhe zanjeerou ke jo dikhaate hai<br>
<br>
Jab wo beemar dukh sunaata hai<br>
Lasha e shaah kaanp jaata hai<br>
____________________________<br>
Pohanche jo aabid jo lasha e sheh par<br>
Bole basad malaal ro ro kar<br>
Kuch qabar aapko hai aye sarwar<br>
Ranj kya kya huwe hai bande par<br>
<br>
Aap ke baad ham aseer huwe<br>
Touq aahan me dastageer huwe<br>
____________________________<br>
Le gaye humko bediya pehna <br>
Aur gardan me touq bhi daala<br>
Aap sote rahe yaha'n baba<br>
Li qabar bhi naa meri kuch islaa<br>
<br>
Dushman e dee'n zabas sataate the<br>
Taaziyaane mujhe lagate the<br>
____________________________<br>
Sun ke ahle haram bhi sheh ki sada<br>
Roye aisa ke hosh bhi na raha<br>
Phir to zainab ne shaah se ye kaha<br>
Bhai aayi hai ye behan dukhya<br>
<br>
Sath ahle haram ko laayi hu<br>
Par sakeena ko khoke aayi hu<br>
____________________________<br>
Boli zainab ke aye shaheed imaam<br>
Aayi hu tai mai kar ke raahe shaam<br>
Ab yaha se naa jaungi ek gaam<br>
Aapki qabr par rahungi madaam<br>
<br>
Is besha me jaan khoungi<br>
Umr bhar aapko mai roungi<br>
____________________________<br>
Bhai sharminda hu mai sughra se<br>
Muh watan me dikhaau kya jaake <br>
Nahi mumkin hai ab ye zainab se<br>
Aapko ban me chod kar jaae'n<br>
<br>
Qabr asghar ki ab banaaungi <br>
Umr bhar baithi qaak udhaaungi<br>
____________________________<br>
Sun ke laasha tadap gaya sheh ka<br>
Aayi halq e bareeda se ye sada<br>
Aye behan duqtare Ali e huda<br>
Kahu'n paighaam kya mai sughra ka<br>
<br>
Mujh ko sajjad se nadaamat hai<br>
Hijr sughra ka ek qayamat hai<br>
____________________________<br>
Laashe akber pe zainab e dilgeer<br>
Aayi jis dam ba haalat e taagheer<br>
Kehti thi haye mere badre muneer<br>
Qaak me teri mil gayi tasweer<br>
<br>
So chuke bas utho utho beta<br>
Aaye sajjad hai milo beta<br>
____________________________<br>
Tum se chut kar huwe ye mujh pe sitam<br>
Qaid kar shaam le gaye azlam<br>
Sar e darbaar be rida the hum<br>
Tasht me tha sar e imame umam<br>
<br>
Sath fouje yazeed thi beta<br>
Qatl e sayyad ki eid thi beta<br>
____________________________<br>
Thi sakina jo shaah ki duqtar<br>
Khadi kehti pidar ke laashe par<br>
Haal beti ka dekho aye sarwar<br>
Baal khole hai apne ro ro kar<br>
<br>
Mujh pe kya kya sitam huwe baba<br>
Muh ka dekho mere waram baba<br>
____________________________<br>
Eid ke roz tumne jo sarwar<br>
The pehnaaye jo kaan me gouhar<br>
Le liya usko shimre bad gouhar<br>
Aur tamache bhi maare hai muh par<br>
<br>
Apna dukh mai sunaane aayi hu<br>
Neel muh ke dikhaane aayi hu<br>
____________________________